# ---- New unified outputs (replaces scattered old dirs) ----
outputs/runs/
outputs/analysis/
# outputs/reports/ holds the hand-written analysis reports and is tracked on
# purpose, unlike the generated artifacts under outputs/analysis/. Anything that
# is not a report (a stray figure, csv or json) is still ignored.
